WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.640
- What was it? 
- What's up Hajime-chan?

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.700
I keep on thinking something really funny happened this morning.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:23.620
- Something funny?  
- Something REALLY funny, but I can't remember.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:30.420
Hmm, what was it?

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:04.770
- One iced coffee coming up.  
- Where's the Master?

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.970
Horse racing in the back.
 Wait, the Master said to take this too.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:12.430
For free? Wow, that's rare.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:15.590
It's not quite ripe yet, so...

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:20.510
... "make sure to put a bunch of salt on it before you serve it," The Master said.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.910
I don't think you can fool them by just putting salt on it.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:25.930
Don't argue.

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:30.520
"Tell them it's a new type of watermelon. They won't know," The Master said.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:38.620
Thank you for waiting. Here's your iced coffee and complimentary...

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.320
- ... salted melon.   
- If the truth is bent constantly ...

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.170
... I wonder if it'll ever be included within the Möbius strip.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.690
Make sure to put a lot of salt on it.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:54.280
Um, sssss....

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.890
- Oh.   
- Can I get some sal-

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:13.110
- I apologize! 
- Are you OK, Kanako?

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.900
Yea. But my vision is a little blurred.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:20.020
What the heck. Kanako, how can your eyes be bad? You're a ghost.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.130
Spare glasses!

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.180
Ohh wow, Arashi!

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:31.780
Why didn't you offer it to me if you had spare ones!

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.550
I already glued it!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:38.330
I thought they were some stylish type of glasses.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.290
Well, it doesn't matter now.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.750
Try this on, Kanako.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:10.890
"Spiral! Summer hurricane!"

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:34.260
To protect the peace of Yachiyo!

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:36.390
I will punish those who get in my way!

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:42.500
Maid Warrior Yamazaki Kanako is here!

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.080
Can't Stop the Romance

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:53.680
Wow, that was a good inquiry that came up all of a sudden.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:58.900
I've found many runaway girls before.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:04.450
Sorry, but that was too easy for me.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:09.820
It's true! Right, Arashi?! Right, Yayoi?!

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.960
Kanako looked great.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.100
As soon as Kanako put her glasses on ...

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:19.050
... there was a bright light that covered her!

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:23.810
She transformed into a beautiful girl! She even had moves to go along with it!

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:28.460
Haha! That sounds like a transforming super heroine.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:33.180
- Transforming super heroine?  
- You don't know? Like <i>Pai Pai</i> and ...

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.790
What? <i>Pai Pai</i>?

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.750
Well, I stopped after <i>Totomesu</i>.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.040
Female sea lion?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.390
I don't know what it is, but it sounds fun!

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:54.900
Right?! As a girl, you always dream of becoming one.

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.390
I even did.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.560
- Hey, Kana-chan.   
- What is it?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.320
Can you transform for us again?

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.820
- I refuse! 
 - Why?

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.650
I don't ever want to do it again!

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:10.560
It felt like the devil controlled my body...

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.400
... and I just started saying things. 
On top of that...

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:19.440
... why would I call myself a beautiful girl?! 
It's too much!

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:25.150
Oh no, it wasn't like that! 
Kana-chan, when you became the maid warrior, it was awesome!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.390
Wha--What?

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:39.910
- Almost! 
- Can't believe you guys.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:47.310
Kanako, can you put on the glasses again, please?

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:06.590
"Spiral! Summer hurricane!"

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:24.540
Woah! Wow, this seems fun.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:27.560
- Told you!   
- Give that to me, Hajime!

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:37.160
Oh no. That vase is made out of expensive baccarat.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:43.340
Well, if you transform in front of me, I'll act as though that never happened.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.160
- No, I don't want to!  
- Alright, now you have to buy me a new vase.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:56.040
- Yo! Are you on your way back?  
- Yes.  
- What's inside that cardboard?

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:58.430
Oh? This?

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:00.130
Come back here, Kanako!

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.620
Kanako-san!

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:11.010
Now! I got it!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.680
"Spiral! Summer hurricane!"

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:24.940
- Look at that! 
- Naked?! She's completely naked!

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:29.580
- Iyaa! Kanako! 
- Her hair is moving like tentacles.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.210
- Iyaaa! Kanako! 
- Wow!

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:34.210
The hair covered three places perfectly!

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:40.120
- Iyaaa! Kanako! 
- Ahh. The tongue is going to take off the glasses!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:50.460
- What? What was that?  
- She was going to transform after that!

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:53.430
She even has moves and phrases that go along with it!

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.900
- Cool phrases? 
- "To protect the peace of Yachio!"

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.090
"I will punish those who get in my way!"

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:03.190
"Maid warrior Yamasaki Kanako is here!"

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.790
Would Kanako do such a thing?

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:09.890
Ahh. If Kanako doesn't like it that much...

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:14.400
... Got it! We should just back off of it then.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.940
So how did that happen?

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.260
I don't know exactly, but...

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.110
... the way that the planets are aligned in the solar system currently...

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:29.240
... affects the power of the ghosts on earth ...

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.400
... the glasses acting as a catalyst ...

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.190
... must have created a drastic change in her!

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:39.380
- What? The glasses?  
- You don't know?

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:42.470
The glasses signify infinite power!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.500
Here, what does this look like?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.180
Oh! It looks like the infinity symbol!

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.950
- Really?   
- You're right, Arashi-san!

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:59.200
- I don't get it at all. 
- Has that ever happened before?

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:02.790
Some things changed when she wore glasses before.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.810
Some things?! It was way beyond SOME!

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.730
- Sorry to keep you waiting! 
- What is this?

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:14.650
- These are heroine costumes!  
- Why do you have all those costumes?

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.250
Because it's every girl's dream!

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.790
- What are you wearing? 
- Now I can be like, "The heroine is here!"

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:26.690
Look, Kanako, you can transform all you want.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.470
- I won't do it!
- Don't be so stubborn.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.770
Then you have to buy me that plate now.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:41.670
Kana-chan, can you get me two waters for table one?

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.730
Arashi, what is that.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.740
It's not all that bad wearing a costume!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.870
Join us, Kana-chan!

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:52.360
- I will not!  
- Here you go. Two waters.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.820
Here we go!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:05.070
- I'm sorry.  
- Got you now!

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.750
Those are also made of baccarat.

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:38.730
Natsu No Arashi

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:45.420
Yamazaki-san, the Master said to go check on the pickles in the back.

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:48.200
OK. I won't ask.

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:53.640
Why are you wearing a uniform?

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:58.150
The Master let me borrow it.
 Rather than being a heroine...

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:01.100
... this one is for girls with super powers.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:04.290
I won't ask.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:10.560
Kanako, we have to mix the pickles every day, right?

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:13.460
Yea, you have to put a lot of love into it.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:18.400
- You must like it a lot.  
- Yea, I even named them.

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.400
How neat!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:24.000
I think pickles live in their own universe.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:28.210
They live in a world that is infinite, yet with order.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:33.540
If there is dirt that enters it, the pickles will die.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.140
Got ya!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:41.500
Oh no! Nukadokonnu!

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:45.270
Ew! It stinks!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.550
What have you done!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:51.460
I swear on Nukadokonnu's life! I won't ever...

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.630
No! Never in my lifetime will I wear glasses again!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:13:00.100
- Hold on, Kanako.   
- Wait, who is Nukadokonnu?

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:05.660
- What's up? Why do you look so angry, Kanako?  
- These are the remains of Nukadokonnu.

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.240
Remains?

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:14.510
- It's all over.
- We have to give up on it.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.290
If the glasses are like this...

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:20.140
- Wait a minute. 
- Huh?

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:24.150
Don't give up just yet.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:28.420
I'm sorry, Kanako.
 I didn't mean to hurt you.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:32.030
It's OK. I know your intentions weren't malicious.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:37.800
It was because you looked so pretty. 
 I just honestly wanted to see it again.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.780
- Come on, Yayoi.  
- But I won't do it again.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:44.020
I don't want to do something that you dislike.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:48.140
Kanako, you are beautiful. 
 Regardless of your transformation.

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:51.000
Now, Yayoi.

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:57.800
I know they don't give up easily. 
 They're still going to come after me.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:02.080
Don't worry! 
 I will protect you Kanako!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.810
Yayoi.

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:10.350
Kanako-san! Yayoi-san!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.920
The Master is calling you.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:19.530
Alright, we're going to make today eyeglasses day!
 Everybody wear your glasses!

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:24.610
- There is a big need for girls with glasses! 
 - Can I ask you something?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:28.520
- Where did you get these glasses from? 
 - He gave them to us.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.900
Oh. Um.

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:35.800
They gave these to me as a reward for finding a runaway girl.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.640
They gave a year's worth of glasses to me.

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:42.300
I can't believe you!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:48.510
OK. OK. Stop with the fighting. 
Hurry up, and wear your glasses!

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:52.310
- Got it. 
- OK!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:58.660
- Yay!  
- Oh, OK.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:05.050
What. Why are you breaking it!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.860
If you work for me with your glasses on...

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:13.090
... I'll forget that you broke my baccarat vase and dishes!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.280
- Everything?
- Yea!

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:19.980
Alright. If you say so.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:28.990
- Kanako! 
- It's OK, Yayoi! If I become the laughing stock, I have no debts!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:33.890
No! I don't want you to be the laughing stock, Kanako!

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:38.540
Thanks, Yayoi, but it's OK.

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:43.800
With this, everything, everything is forgiven!

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:51.850
"Spiral! Summer hurricane!"

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.050
NO!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.940
Ka--na--ko!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.760
Don't! 
Don't come near!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:19.420
It's OK, Kanako!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.020
What?

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:29.850
What about this, Master?

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.580
Can I have some salt?

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:37.200
I think there is a need for glasses to be worn like this too!

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:40.340
You're right. That looks...

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:45.040
- ... cute! 
- Kanako is going to be wearing her glasses like this today.

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:48.290
Yayoi, you didn't have to.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:55.950
- I'm sorry, Kanako   
- I'm sorry too.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:58.680
Hajime.
 Arashi.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:03.660
It was my bad.
 Glasses aren't supposed to be forced on.

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:09.430
You reminded me that they're supposed to be worn naturally.

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:11.230
What the hell are you saying?

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.320
Are you trying make us forget what you have done?

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:16.930
I don't think that's what he meant, Jun.

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.830
Oh, there's something on the floor.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:54.220
"Spiral, Summer hurricane!"

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:58.700
- Ahh!
 - We almost had it!

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.430
Arashi, you're starting to become like Hajime.

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:04.050
You two are so ruthless.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:08.290
As a scientist, I should never give up!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.890
Right! You're right!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.740
Um, can I get some salt?

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:17.940
- Hey, where are we going? 
 - We're going to put an end to this!

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:29.850
I can't believe the Master sent me out this early!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:33.350
She's going to snack on this tonight.
I know it!

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:45.850
Oh! What the hell are you doing, stop!

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:52.250
Hey you! Give it back! That's mine!

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.380
If you're a real man fight like one!

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:59.370
Oh, that reminds me.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.650
ha ha ha
 Don't underestimate me.

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:07.550
I have a --- spare pair!

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.730
What is going on?!

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:19.920
To protect the peace of Yachiyo!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.960
I will punish those who get in my way!

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:27.640
Maid warrior Yamasaki Kanako is here!

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:40.780
Ahaha! What are you wearing?! Aahaha!

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.520
There'll be no questions asked!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:47.750
May I borrow your glasses?

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:51.540
Oh, here you go.

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:03.000
(Casting a spell) 
May your memories dissipate!

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:14.390
Alright then. I'll see you later!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.300
Huh? What just happened?

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:26.730
- That's all you're going to do? 
- Now he can't put glasses on me anymore.

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:31.970
Wait, really?

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:56.180
Wait, could this be?

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:33.640
- How are you feeling, Yayoi? 
- I'm quite well, Kanako.

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:39.590
- Oh, that's good to hear. 
- I found another great action shot.

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:43.350
Oh, what kind of action shot could this be?

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:47.030
Well it's--- I forgot the title.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:51.620
- Can you tell me what kind of story it is? 
- Yes, I sure will.

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:58.180
It is a story in the colorful world of show business.

00:22:58.320 --> 00:23:00.900
One filled with fantasy.

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:06.380
In the midst of human interaction that take place on the gleaming and glistening stage...

00:23:06.730 --> 00:23:09.630
... the mysterious and attractive girl brought about ...

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:14.550
... great inspiration and hope to the people.

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:18.000
What a wonderful story!

00:23:18.100 --> 00:23:22.570
There is something that the girl with the angelic voice always says.

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:25.320
What is it?

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:29.780
(Pampuru Pimpuru)

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:35.000
- When I say magical girl.  
- A mysterious animal?

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:39.230
It's cute. It talks, jumps, and is colorful!

00:23:39.370 --> 00:23:44.240
- You'll need an A class license too.  
- Have to wake up early tomorrow!

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:44.750
Next Week: Jagged Heart Lullaby

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:50.210
 See you next week!
